WEBVTT

00:32:57.479 --> 00:33:01.051
The answer is that you have to expose
yourself to the thing that you fear,

00:33:01.075 --> 00:33:03.972
but you have to do it
in really small doses.

00:33:03.996 --> 00:33:06.726
So, you can't start out
by giving the TED Talk.

00:33:06.750 --> 00:33:08.139
And in my case,

00:33:08.163 --> 00:33:12.557
I went and signed up for this seminar
on public speaking anxiety,

00:33:12.581 --> 00:33:16.131
and all you had to do in the seminar,
the very first day you would show up,

00:33:16.155 --> 00:33:17.741
and you would just say your name

00:33:17.765 --> 00:33:19.812
and then sit back down
and declare victory.

00:33:19.836 --> 00:33:22.173
And you were done! And that was it.

00:33:22.197 --> 00:33:25.565
And then you'd go back the next week
and you'd do a little bit more,

00:33:25.589 --> 00:33:27.205
a little more and a little more.

00:33:27.229 --> 00:33:30.809
And it's the most amazing thing,
how you can extinguish a fear that way.